  "Todo emprendimiento comienza con una idea, pero pocas veces sobrevive sin un plan que la respalde. Antes de lanzar un producto al mercado, es fundamental entender a quién va dirigido y qué problema resuelve realmente. Muchos negocios fracasan no por falta de calidad, sino por no encontrar suficientes clientes dispuestos a pagar por ellos. Validar la idea antes de invertir suele ahorrar tiempo y dinero.": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Every venture starts with an idea, but rarely survives without a plan that backs it up. Before launching a product to the market, it is essential to understand who it is targeted at and what problem it really solves. Many businesses fail not due to lack of quality, but because they don't find enough customers willing to pay for them. Validating the idea before investing usually saves time and money.",
