      "text": "Cash flow is, for many small businesses, even more important than profits reported on paper. A business can be profitable and still go bankrupt due to lack of immediate liquidity. Therefore, keeping a detailed control of monthly income and expenses results indispensable from the first day. The errors of financial management usually appear much earlier than what one thinks.",
